    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="773515ea-59cd-53ed-a996-9f979bc3229a" activityNameId="2896e77b-05b2-52cf-8191-5d0a66a8b24e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pumice, at mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pumice, at mine
For a lack of data the dust emissions for bauxite mining are used as proxy. Further following proxys have been used: The amount of water has been copied from the water consumption in "sand, at mine"-wasing and for heating the "light fuel oil"-heating module has been used.;
UUID: 79495d49-03cc-31f6-8417-9f5cb472c85a
includes excavation by digger,  transportation within mine, washing, the land-use of the mine, the recultivation and dust emissions
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: technology unknown
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: sampled from different other modules (some data copied from "limestone crushing", some from "bentonite mining", some from "recultivation, limestone mine", etc.). 
Extrapolations: data which are only available for GLO, RER and CH have been used as proxy for D
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_79495d49-03cc-31f6-8417-9f5cb472c85a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
